      "cuad_CERES_INC_01_25_2012_EX_10_20_Collaborat__cuad_CERES_INC_01_25_2012_EX_10_20_Collab_836bcf4c__14": "14",
      "cuad_CERES_INC_01_25_2012_EX_10_20_Collaborat__cuad_CERES_INC_01_25_2012_EX_10_20_Collab_836bcf4c__14.3": "2 In case of termination on the basis of Article 14.1 (b) if IGER is the breaching Party, Article 14.1 (c) if IGER ceases substantially all  activities in the COLLABORATION CROPS, Article 14.1 (e) (i) or (ii) or Article 14.1 (f), subject to the obligations of the first sentence of Article  14.3, CERES shall have the exclusive right to use and commercially exploit any JOINT INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY to the extent such JOINT         CERES-IGER Collaboration Agreement    Page 24 of 75",
